":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"18085","date":"2026-11-21T19:02:31+00:00","text":"He's the FUTURE of Juventus. Arman Durmiši. REMEMBER THE NAME. 🇦🇱 🔥","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/cHdHPKP-piNioiSxFrszFJD1ByQtAShrApwrgrXFOIJubt_AA7EmPvmNnQQjqFDEJAIJIuOhFAiS4EtDSabwEXU5Dez8KnteyaySYRYSTdbfqn1nqgtLut9nSTbD1fPiBT0QGA9fSJOIj9ddLii4UEV9ZgizOHRwO7MxQmkgelK5fMq6FRC6X_yVnTKuauYULMGbn2uvwoYlB6LLxlWaeOIW2EgVzH1KLEAr5tFXLOuuaKUxhivbMqndqBUXGs-YvPMttl0_YD0te57gJecUbRFaNlgKfMr31_05KtzF4UOIQHEZNHhbIFGh5jCfSkifuQPdF5xaavPjp_HIkj_9GQ.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"18084","date":"2026-11-21T16:47:20+00:00","text":"🎙️ Luciano Spalletti’s #JuveVenezia press conference: • Kalulu and Nico González will not be available. • Conceição will be assessed. Sooner or later, he’ll be back on the pitch. • Woltemade feels comfortable playing in his new role. I’m convinced he’ll succeed. • Ekhator is an important prospect. I hope he continues improving his physical condition. • I really don’t understand why there’s so much fuss about Zidane and Conte’s comments. • I’m preparing for this 600th match with exactly the same excitement I felt before my first. • Spoke to McKennie after his interview, I didn’t get the impression that he wanted to leave. • Gatti is trying to add something more to his game beyond simply defending. • We’ll face a side that plays very vertically. As soon as they regain possession, they immediately look to attack the space behind the opposition.","image":"https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/tewqsUpeNX-3v-vwQpl4cmI3_EnGBH6WTSdfPranK1uGK6T_XBJAjEgwlnBNet-cS6gB4x59ZNOuBWME8DU0x2NX_f48vIiAaBeTg44djCCKg6IKZYQulbHfOnNDfCymNzbxlQboP0o68UJ50knsZBp_7RbTtjRhdbeYQEBHecr6PbeQ0SOnxw1F3PTvzOLxwXJJASZpUvJPKsozMeqS6zEXyptFeb829HG_itm-ClhSQYSd7BPDxZhdM9qyfw-vsOYIW1J_B2NH_jgzeNVszQV9vAFz5mOf6-fpx-d7wJm9tk7VTlt5kHwVOUufo8h_Jaq9S8rv0V3UHatRXOSMhw.jpg","video":"","hasVideo":false},{"id":"18083","date":"2026-11-21T15:38:01+00:00","text":"\"Kalulu and Nico Gonzalez will not be with us tomor